71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0Eg2_quJUiMQ7kNvwGZfTrp&_nc_oc=AdoIKRgDgh8LLU-eiweF9luL7suAfF0Mk_5aNgp_N6RrbVoLY-pY-I1ZNUpCppRAOXQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCrBrXrA5HiCyBHGGsLShpowUQQ7poqnQrGXTG0KI-mUw&oe=6A636439"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_AbV7DraZCAQ7kNvwE4RTfs&_nc_oc=AdoRjGY_RCqZyiGO3ngtswpkk335_TMQPoJpz5RFFr7CBH_zr-j_rOxSfsTKt347BTM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDE2ZyhHltsuWUIJyYh5BG8S0Dv29bmkD-KFOSy1JkuWQ&oe=6A637713"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=r8J429xg9x4Q7kNvwHG5Dk9&_nc_oc=Ado4qMIi13Wc-bXdi8KCJhZlNm34uydTqi43g6DFnsuf-I5Fmj26GEKySKzhdPOO8Sw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQD6Bx_THr5ehmxxzbVhPmbkDJ6DhU-v0qNZ7i3KsX_ACw&oe=6A63755A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: